43⟶800$\n\n- length: $1\\,617⟶1\\,600$\n\nTherefore, the ratio of width to length (expressed as a fraction) is approximately\n\n$$\n\\frac{800}{1\\,600}.\n$$\n\nWe can simplify this ratio by dividing both numbers by $100$:\n\n$$\n\\frac{800÷100}{1\\,600÷100}=\\frac{8}{16}\n$$\n\nThen, we divide by $8$:\n\n$$\n\\frac{8÷8}{16÷8}=\\frac{1}{2}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the ratio of width to length is approximately $\\frac{1}{2}.$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186499513 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186499434 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "01f99115-f376-50c2-9b7e-79800006d437" :knowledge-point/title "Finding a Value Given a Ratio by Rounding an Amount"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "07503364-4d4e-57d2-bb77-f0ad9574a985" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "$$2800$" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186498742} {:answer/id #uuid "b59ff6dc-d30e-5cd3-9cd5-ee41c27ed72b" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "$$3200$" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186499134} {:answer/id #uuid "c0385104-a86b-5617-b3aa-b06b49ab6b02" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "$$2400$" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186499156} {:answer/id #uuid "d6107588-030a-56f4-a9d0-e0374535cf03" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "$$2100$" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186499208} {:answer/id #uuid "d6915496-7a5c-57b9-8639-75286d6bd22d" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "$$3000$" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186499211}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "07503364-4d4e-57d2-bb77-f0ad9574a985" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "$$2800$" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186498742} :answer-field/id #uuid "a53fabe5-f69e-5ef4-b936-049629805ba8" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045493 :db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186499390}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045485 :db/ident :question.difficulty/easy} :question/id #uuid "989f692a-e9cc-5d93-9c14-352947770c60" :question/math-academy-id "q-364167" :question/problem "Emma and Noah get paid for mowing lawns. The ratio of Emma's reward to Noah's reward is $7:3.$ \nDuring a particular week, Noah received $$1215.$ By rounding Noah's earnings to the nearest hundred, approximate the amount of money that Emma received." :question/worked-solution "First, let's approximate the amount of money that Noah received:\n\n$$\n$1215⟶$1200\n$$\n\nThe ratio of Emma's earnings to Noah's earnings is\n\n$$\n\\frac{7}{3}.\n$$\n\n  \n\nThe numerator represents Emma's earnings  and the denominator represents Noah's earnings.\n\nWe can make a denominator of $1200$ by multiplying the numerator and denominator by \n $400$:\n\n$$\n\\frac{7\\times 400}{3\\times 400}=\\frac{2800}{1200}.\n$$\n\nTherefore, Emma received approximately $$2800.$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186499501 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186499434 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "01f99115-f376-50c2-9b7e-79800006d437" :knowledge-point/title "Finding a Value Given a Ratio by Rounding an Amount"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "13ed95b8-32f9-5781-9f81-9678fab31222" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "700" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186498773} {:answer/id #uuid "228894c5-7c4f-5cbd-893c-1456fbd83512" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "500" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186498807} {:answer/id #uuid "6f8e2cc9-3cae-5add-8f8d-e7298ffdb233" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "900" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186498978} {:answer/id #uuid "b388ad8f-2935-5568-b7d3-67afea27f938" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math}